["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok內幕：張一鳴的巨浪征途》音頻版（上集） ARPU Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2022-04-29-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-曾是-facebook-最尊贵的客户-直到日活破亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/297c1019274060ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">35:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 曾是 Facebook 最尊貴的客戶，直到日活破億</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 早期最重要的投放渠道是 Facebook，推廣預算每個季度增長 100% 以上；Facebook 認定它留存太差、留不住用戶，反而把流量導給它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Apple WWDC Steve Jobs’ last keynote Mission Control Launchpad PhotoStream iTunes Match Notification Center\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2011-06-06-ch-applevideoarchive-乔布斯最后一次发布会-pc被降级-只是云端的一个设备/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84c8d5f0e521ef27-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:58:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AppleVideoArchive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2011</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯最後一次發布會：PC被降級，只是雲端的一個設備</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯宣布：PC不再是存放照片、音樂和文件的數字中樞，這個角色現在要交給雲——iCloud讓所有設備自動同步，用戶甚至不需要打開任何同步軟件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">iCloud</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs introduces unibody MacBook Pro &amp; MacBook (2008) unibody EPEAT Gold\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2008-10-14-ch-wim-speelt-hd-full-苹果造macbook的秘诀-从更厚的一整块铝开始-再削掉大半/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c877a66c45f4d8ea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">52:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Wim Speelt Hd full</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2008</span></div>\n<h2>蘋果造MacBook的秘訣：從更厚的一整塊鋁開始，再削掉大半</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘋果發現：從更厚的一整塊鋁削出單一結構件，比拼接多個薄金屬件更輕更強；這套工藝後來被下放到降價700美元的入門款MacBook。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件設計</span><span class=\"tag\">一體成型工藝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs and Bill Gates at the 2007 All Things Digital conference post-PC devices natural user interface\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2007-05-30-ch-brioweb-agenzia-di-marketing-e-comunicaz-乔布斯与盖茨罕见同台-苹果能活-靠的是放弃打败微软/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a64cbad505656589-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">BrioWeb Agenzia di marketing e comunicazione</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2007</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯與蓋茨罕見同臺：蘋果能活，靠的是放棄打敗微軟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯說蘋果1997年的轉折點不是技術突破，而是承認「蘋果不用打敗微軟」，停止零和遊戲才保住了公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">微軟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"D5 2007: Steve Jobs interviewed by Walt Mossberg iTunes Plus OCAP AAC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2007-05-30-ch-video-insider-乔布斯说日本家电巨头做不好软件-这就是ipod和iphone能赢的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b0c5421b726dec9b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">53:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Video Insider</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2007</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯說日本家電巨頭做不好軟件，這就是iPod和iPhone能贏的原因</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯認為蘋果真正的護城河不是硬件，而是軟件能力差距——日本消費電子巨頭和手機廠商始終造不出像樣的軟件，這才是iPod和iPhone能贏的根本原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">iPhone</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs introduces the first iPhone at Macworld 2007 --- REMASTERED and UPSCALED with AI to 4K multi-touch visual voicemail push IMAP cover flow\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2007-01-09-ch-debuggingthematrix-乔布斯定价iphone时的逻辑-别人的智能手机根本不是对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/26dfdde48ab52c34-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">DebuggingTheMatrix</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2007</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯定價iPhone時的邏輯：別人的智能手機根本不是對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯把iPhone定價在和普通iPod同樣的499美元，理由是這臺機器集齊了別的手機要花幾百美元才能單獨買到的功能，卻一分錢溢價都沒加。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品發布</span><span class=\"tag\">定價策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs&#x27; 2005 Stanford Commencement Address (with intro by President John Hennessy) Whole Earth Catalog\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2005-06-12-ch-stanford-乔布斯-被苹果开除-是我经历过最好的事情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/12db0bcde8d71255-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Stanford</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2005</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯：被蘋果開除，是我經歷過最好的事情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">30歲被自己創立的公司公開解僱後，喬布斯才進入人生最有創造力的五年，催生了NeXT和Pixar,最終帶著那段技術重新回到蘋果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業</span><span class=\"tag\">職業挫折</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs&#x27; CAUSE 1998 Annual Conference General Session white box PC thin client G.Lite\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1998-12-08-ch-retrobyte-乔布斯承认-去年最热门的十款游戏-一款都没在mac上运行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8191576fde4cfd79-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">RetroByte</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1998</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯承認：去年最熱門的十款遊戲，一款都沒在Mac上運行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯承認，蘋果連續多年沒能把任何一款當紅遊戲帶到Mac上，這個自我批評比他對外部競爭對手的任何評價都更直白。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">史蒂夫·喬布斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Apple Special Event 1998 (Full Keynote) | AppleArchivesPro Bytemark AGP (Advanced Graphics Port) USB (Universal Serial Bus)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1998-01-06-ch-wim-speelt-hd-full-乔布斯用跑分和实机对决-证明g3芯片以一半时钟频率打平奔腾ii/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dcb8a0c4dcf8645d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">26:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Wim Speelt Hd full</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1998</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯用跑分和實機對決，證明G3芯片以一半時鐘頻率打平奔騰II</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘋果沒有正面比較價格，而是現場把同價位甚至更貴的康柏筆記本和iMac拉上臺，用Photoshop和Director文件做計時賽，讓G3在觀眾眼前贏下每一局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">喬布斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Complete Apple WWDC | Steve Jobs talk and answer developers questions | 1997 OpenDoc Rhapsody NFS chirp / CHRP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1997-05-13-ch-theapplefanboy-apple-computer-archives-乔布斯1997预言-电脑该拿掉硬盘-网络比本地存储更快更可靠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c36d7b92b55ce2d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">TheAppleFanBoy - Apple &amp; Computer Archives</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1997</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯1997預言：電腦該拿掉硬盤，網絡比本地存儲更快更可靠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他講自己把家目錄全放在NeXT的服務器上，七年沒丟過一次數據、也沒備份過電腦；他說千兆以太網一來，個人電腦裡除了鍵盤鼠標，其它活動部件都該拿掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">喬布斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"NeXT, OpenStep and the return of Steve Jobs to Apple Blue Box / Yellow Box OpenStep Interface Builder Rhapsody\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1997-01-07-ch-dirk-bockstegers-苹果收购next发布会-jobs说三人车库团队能打败150人大厂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/734b329b38d59e19-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">45:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Dirk Bockstegers</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1997</span></div>\n<h2>蘋果收購NeXT發布會：Jobs說三人車庫團隊能打敗150人大廠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘋果管理層把Mac OS比作需要換引擎的塞斯納飛機，而Jobs現場演示的OpenStep讓開發者從「五樓」直接起步到「二十樓」，這才是收購NeXT的真正理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">NeXT收購</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Pixar&#x27;s early days: an interview with Steve Jobs (1996) Sillywood\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1996-11-22-ch-steve-jobs-archive-乔布斯说-pixar-权力结构是倒着的-ceo排在最底层/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f32a8de44a1dc2a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Steve Jobs Archive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1996</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯說：Pixar 權力結構是倒著的，CEO排在最底層</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因為頂尖創意人才和頂尖圖形學人才都極度稀缺、隨時可能跳槽，喬布斯說 Pixar 的管理層必須倒著伺候他們，CEO反而成了最底層。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人才管理</span><span class=\"tag\">公司文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs: The Fresh Air Interview (1996) | Fresh Air object-oriented programming graphical user interface (GUI) blue box\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1996-02-22-freshair-乔布斯1996年预言-软件将彻底搬到网上下载-24个月内实现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bcc411a4204a4f9b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">31:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1996</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯1996年預言：軟件將徹底搬到網上下載，24個月內實現</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">離開蘋果後喬布斯反思：Next做硬件是重走成功老路，沒看清世界已變——真正值錢的不是圖形界面本身，而是網絡和面向對象編程這兩件他79年在Xerox沒看懂的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">Next</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Building NeXT from the ground up (PBS &quot;Entrepreneurs&quot;, 1986) reality distortion simulated learning environments\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1986-01-01-ch-steve-jobs-archive-乔布斯的现实扭曲-被自己团队当面反驳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/11ee91b1d295e29c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">20:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Steve Jobs Archive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1986</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯的現實扭曲，被自己團隊當面反駁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這期NeXT內部錄像罕見捕捉到員工當面告訴喬布斯：他標誌性的現實扭曲套路一旦影響到產品設計決策，就是團隊日後返工重來的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Steve Jobs</span><span class=\"tag\">NeXT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs presentation, around 1980 (Computer History Museum, gift of Regis McKenna) VisiCalc fictitious business name statement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/1980-01-01-ch-computer-history-museum-乔布斯1980年演讲-苹果的使命是消灭人机之间的学习门槛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21aabaf2fa470162-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">23:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Computer History Museum</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1980</span></div>\n<h2>喬布斯1980年演講：蘋果的使命是消滅人機之間的學習門檻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喬布斯認為蘋果真正要賣的不是硬件和軟件的數量，而是讓任何不懂編程的人都能直接解決問題，他相信這個門檻會在未來36個月內被攻破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">喬布斯</span>\n</div></div></a>"]